        "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-027-yinjun-complete:p002",
        "start_codepoint": 48,
        "end_codepoint": 65,
        "human_reviewed": false
      },
      {
        "id": "c-liangshu-027-yinjun-complete:received_sentence2-65",
        "kind": "received_sentence",
        "person_id": "ceq_pnr_q0e_A",
        "source_quote": "遷驃騎從事中郎，中書郎、太子家令、掌東宮書記。",
        "reading": "遷驃騎從事中郎、中書郎、太子家令，掌東宮書記。",
        "note": "遷驃騎從事中郎、中書郎、太子家令，掌東宮書記。",
        "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-027-yinjun-complete:p002",
        "start_codepoint": 65,
        "end_codepoint": 88,
        "human_reviewed": false
      },
      {
        "id": "c-liangshu-027-yinjun-complete:received_sentence2-88",
        "kind": "received_sentence",
        "person_id": "ceq_pnr_q0e_A",
        "source_quote": "頃之，遷給事黃門侍郎、中庶子、尚書吏部郎、司徒左長史，侍中。",
        "reading": "遷黃門侍郎、中庶子、尚書吏部郎、司徒左長史、侍中。",
        "note": "遷黃門侍郎、中庶子、尚書吏部郎、司徒左長史、侍中。",
        "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-027-yinjun-complete:p002",
        "start_codepoint": 88,
        "end_codepoint": 118,
        "human_reviewed": false
      },
      {
        "id": "c-liangshu-027-yinjun-complete:received_sentence2-118",
        "kind": "received_sentence",
        "person_id": "ceq_pnr_q0e_A",
        "source_quote": "東宮置學士，復以鈞爲之。",
        "reading": "為新置東宮學士。",
        "note": "為新置東宮學士。",
        "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-027-yinjun-complete:p002",
        "start_codepoint": 118,
        "end_codepoint": 130,
        "human_reviewed": false
      },
      {
        "id": "c-liangshu-027-yinjun-complete:received_sentence2-130",
        "kind": "received_sentence",
        "person_id": "ceq_pnr_q0e_A",
        "source_quote": "公事免。",
        "reading": "以公事免。",
        "note": "以公事免。",
        "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-027-yinjun-complete:p002",
        "start_codepoint": 130,
        "end_codepoint": 134,
        "human_reviewed": false
      },
      {
        "id": "c-liangshu-027-yinjun-complete:received_sentence2-134",
        "kind": "received_sentence",
        "person_id": "ceq_pnr_q0e_A",
        "source_quote": "復爲中庶子，領國子博士、左驍騎將軍，博士如故。",
        "reading": "復中庶子，領國子博士、左驍騎將軍。",
        "note": "復中庶子，領國子博士、左驍騎將軍。",
        "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-027-yinjun-complete:p002",
        "start_codepoint": 134,
        "end_codepoint": 157,
        "human_reviewed": false
      },
      {
        "id": "c-liangshu-027-yinjun-complete:received_sentence2-157",
        "kind": "received_sentence",
        "person_id": "ceq_pnr_q0e_A",
        "source_quote": "出爲明威將軍、臨川內史。",
        "reading": "出為明威將軍、臨川內史。",
        "note": "出為明威將軍、臨川內史。",
        "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-027-yinjun-complete:p002",
        "start_codepoint": 157,
        "end_codepoint": 169,
        "human_reviewed": false
      },
      {
        "id": "c-liangshu-027-yinjun-complete:received_sentence3-0",
        "kind": "received_sentence",
        "person_id": "ceq_pnr_q0e_A",
        "source_quote": "鈞體羸多疾，閉閤臥治，而百姓化其德，劫盜皆奔出境。",
        "reading": "臨川內史鈞體弱臥治，傳載劫盜出境。數位閉閤，殿本閉閣。",
        "note": "臨川內史鈞體弱臥治，傳載劫盜出境。數位閉閤，殿本閉閣。",
        "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-027-yinjun-complete:p003",
        "start_codepoint": 0,
        "end_codepoint": 25,
        "human_reviewed": false
      },
      {
        "id": "c-liangshu-027-yinjun-complete:received_sentence3-25",
        "kind": "received_sentence",
        "person_id": "ceq_pnr_q0e_A",
        "source_quote": "嘗禽劫帥，不加考掠，但和言誚責。",
        "reading": "傳稱捕得劫帥，鈞以和言誚責。",
        "note": "傳稱捕得劫帥，鈞以和言誚責。",
        "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-027-yinjun-complete:p003",
        "start_codepoint": 25,
        "end_codepoint": 41,
        "human_reviewed": false
      },
      {
        "id": "c-liangshu-027-yinjun-complete:received_sentence3-41",
        "kind": "received_sentence",
        "person_id": "ceq_pnr_q0e_A",
        "source_quote": "劫帥稽顙乞改過，鈞便命遣之，後遂爲善人。",
        "reading": "劫帥乞改，鈞釋之，傳稱後為善人。",
        "note": "劫帥乞改，鈞釋之，傳稱後為善人。",
        "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-027-yinjun-complete:p003",
        "start_codepoint": 41,
        "end_codepoint": 61,
        "human_reviewed": false
      },
      {
        "id": "c-liangshu-027-yinjun-complete:received_sentence3-61",
        "kind": "received_sentence",
        "person_id": "ceq_pnr_q0e_A",
        "source_quote": "郡舊多山瘧，更暑必動，自鈞在任，郡境無復瘧疾。",
        "reading": "郡有山瘧。任內無復瘧疾為本傳敘述。",
        "note": "郡有山瘧。任內無復瘧疾為本傳敘述。",
        "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-027-yinjun-complete:p003",
        "start_codepoint": 61,
        "end_codepoint": 84,
        "human_reviewed": false
      },
      {
        "id": "c-liangshu-027-yinjun-complete:received_sentence3-84",
        "kind": "received_sentence",
        "person_id": "ceq_pnr_q0e_A",
        "source_quote": "母憂去職，居喪過禮，昭明太子憂之，手書誡喻曰：「知比諸德，哀頓爲過，又所進殆無一溢，甚以酸耿。",
        "reading": "母喪去職，昭明太子手令勸其進食。",
        "note": "母喪去職，昭明太子手令勸其進食。",
        "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-027-yinjun-complete:p003",
        "start_codepoint": 84,
        "end_codepoint": 131,
        "human_reviewed": false
      },
      {
        "id": "c-liangshu-027-yinjun-complete:received_sentence3-131",
        "kind": "received_sentence",
        "person_id": "ceq_pnr_q0e_A",
        "source_quote": "迥然一身，宗奠是寄，毀而滅性，聖教所不許。",
        "reading": "太子以一身繫宗奠勸勿過哀。數位迥然，殿本迴然並有考證疑字。",
        "note": "太子以一身繫宗奠勸勿過哀。數位迥然，殿本迴然並有考證疑字。",
        "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-027-yinjun-complete:p003",
        "start_codepoint": 131,
        "end_codepoint": 152,
        "human_reviewed": false
      },
      {
        "id": "c-liangshu-027-yinjun-complete:received_sentence3-152",
        "kind": "received_sentence",
        "person_id": "ceq_pnr_q0e_A",
        "source_quote": "宜微自遣割，俯存禮制，穀粥果蔬，少加勉強。",
        "reading": "勸鈞稍進食，數位穀粥，殿本饘粥。",
        "note": "勸鈞稍進食，數位穀粥，殿本饘粥。",
        "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-027-yinjun-complete:p003",
        "start_codepoint": 152,
        "end_codepoint": 173,
        "human_reviewed": false
      },
      {
        "id": "c-liangshu-027-yinjun-complete:received_sentence3-173",
        "kind": "received_sentence",
        "person_id": "ceq_pnr_q0e_A",
        "source_quote": "憂懷旣深，指故有及，並令繆道臻口具。」",
        "reading": "命繆道臻口頭詳告，手令至此。",
        "note": "命繆道臻口頭詳告，手令至此。",
        "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-027-yinjun-complete:p003",
        "start_codepoint": 173,
        "end_codepoint": 192,
        "human_reviewed": false
      },
      {
        "id": "c-liangshu-027-yinjun-complete:received_sentence3-192",
        "kind": "received_sentence",
        "person_id": "ceq_pnr_q0e_A",
        "source_quote": "鈞答曰：「奉賜手令，並繆道臻宣旨，伏讀感咽，肝心塗地。",
        "reading": "殷鈞覆太子，謝領手令與口旨。",
        "note": "殷鈞覆太子，謝領手令與口旨。",
        "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-027-yinjun-complete:p003",
        "start_codepoint": 192,
        "end_codepoint": 219,
        "human_reviewed": false
      },
      {
        "id": "c-liangshu-027-yinjun-complete:received_sentence3-219",
        "kind": "received_sentence",
        "person_id": "ceq_pnr_q0e_A",
        "source_quote": "小人無情，動不及禮，但稟生尫劣，假推年歲，罪戾所鐘，復加橫疾。",
        "reading": "鈞自言羸病，稱小人。",
        "note": "鈞自言羸病，稱小人。",
        "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-027-yinjun-complete:p003",
        "start_codepoint": 219,
        "end_codepoint": 250,
        "human_reviewed": false
      },
      {
        "id": "c-liangshu-027-yinjun-complete:received_sentence3-250",
        "kind": "received_sentence",
        "person_id": "ceq_pnr_q0e_A",
        "source_quote": "頃者綿微，守盡晷漏，目亂玄黃，心迷哀樂，惟救危苦，未能以遠理自製。",
        "reading": "鈞陳病中耳目心神。",
        "note": "鈞陳病中耳目心神。",
        "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-027-yinjun-complete:p003",
        "start_codepoint": 250,
        "end_codepoint": 283,
        "human_reviewed": false
      },
      {
        "id": "c-liangshu-027-yinjun-complete:received_sentence3-283",
        "kind": "received_sentence",
        "person_id": "ceq_pnr_q0e_A",
        "source_quote": "姜桂之滋，實聞前典，不避粱肉，復忝今慈，臣亦何人，降此憂愍。",
        "reading": "以姜桂與粱肉答太子勸食，臣自指鈞。",
        "note": "以姜桂與粱肉答太子勸食，臣自指鈞。",
        "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-027-yinjun-complete:p003",
        "start_codepoint": 283,
        "end_codepoint": 313,
        "human_reviewed": false
      },
      {
        "id": "c-liangshu-027-yinjun-complete:received_sentence3-313",
        "kind": "received_sentence",
        "person_id": "ceq_pnr_q0e_A",
        "source_quote": "謹當循復聖言，思自補續，如脫申延，實由亭造。」",
        "reading": "申言將奉命保生。",
        "note": "申言將奉命保生。",
        "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-027-yinjun-complete:p003",
        "start_codepoint": 313,
        "end_codepoint": 336,
        "human_reviewed": false
      },
      {
        "id": "c-liangshu-027-yinjun-complete:received_sentence3-336",
        "kind": "received_sentence",
        "person_id": "ceq_pnr_q0e_A",
        "source_quote": "服闋，遷五兵尚書，猶以頓瘵經時，不堪拜受，乃更授散騎常侍、領步兵校尉，侍東宮。",
        "reading": "服闋遷五兵尚書，病久不堪拜受；更授散騎常侍，領步兵校尉。",
        "note": "服闋遷五兵尚書，病久不堪拜受；更授散騎常侍，領步兵校尉。",
        "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-027-yinjun-complete:p003",
        "start_codepoint": 336,
        "end_codepoint": 375,
        "human_reviewed": false
      },
      {
        "id": "c-liangshu-027-yinjun-complete:received_sentence3-375",
        "kind": "received_sentence",
        "person_id": "ceq_pnr_q0e_A",
        "source_quote": "尋改領中庶子。",
        "reading": "其後改領中庶子。",
        "note": "其後改領中庶子。",
        "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-027-yinjun-complete:p003",
        "start_codepoint": 375,
        "end_codepoint": 382,
        "human_reviewed": false
      },
